Could ANY exit rule rescue a grab entry? An exit-free look at the path.

POST-HOC DIAGNOSTIC. No verdict, no prereg, no fees.
Read the GAP between 'every grab' and 'random bars'. A row read
against 50% means nothing — see the module docstring.

